WEBVTT

00:14.410 --> 00:17.960
Please send this to the Royal Magi Assembly.

00:18.270 --> 00:19.790
With pleasure, sir.

00:23.090 --> 00:27.170
I wonder if that boy will heed me.

00:27.170 --> 00:30.130
I cannot say...

00:30.560 --> 00:32.900
He's an eccentric one, after all.

00:34.060 --> 00:37.230
However, if all goes well,

00:37.230 --> 00:42.460
we will become powerful enough 
to stand against the Hawkes.

02:12.990 --> 02:15.990
"Theatergoing"

02:21.530 --> 02:23.540
It's finally over...

02:23.540 --> 02:27.000
Yes, according to the reports
 from the knights,

02:27.370 --> 02:31.960
the monster population in our kingdom 
has now returned to normal.

02:32.790 --> 02:35.180
This all seemed so long, yet so short.

02:35.670 --> 02:38.140
I believe that is thanks to Lady Sei.

02:39.060 --> 02:43.220
Thus the duties of the Holy Saint 
are concluded for the time being.

02:44.280 --> 02:48.340
Making panaceas, researching medicinal
 plants, and creating new recipes...

02:48.340 --> 02:50.770
She has business in many areas.

02:50.770 --> 02:56.530
We performed the Saint-summoning ritual 
in order to purify the miasma.

02:56.530 --> 03:00.030
We cannot force any duties 
upon her beyond that.

03:00.030 --> 03:06.420
That said, I believe Lady Sei herself 
may be wanting of something to call a "mission."

03:11.450 --> 03:13.300
A mission, you say?

03:16.390 --> 03:22.260
Do you recall the time we went out
 on a little boat to go fishing long ago?

03:23.380 --> 03:26.680
That was back when you were
 still just a prince.

03:26.680 --> 03:32.150
You said that you'd go fishing 
all day long once you retired.

03:33.300 --> 03:35.110
I remember.

03:36.020 --> 03:37.320
What do you think?

03:37.320 --> 03:41.280
Let's say the two of us retire tomorrow.

03:41.670 --> 03:44.500
Will you go fishing with me again?

03:45.060 --> 03:47.190
To tell you the truth...

03:48.650 --> 03:51.670
I've no doubt I'd bring
 in twice the haul you did.

03:51.670 --> 03:55.720
Well, I'd bring in one that's much bigger 
than anything you can catch.

03:55.720 --> 03:59.390
We said similar things in the past.

03:59.390 --> 04:02.350
And how did that turn out?

04:04.460 --> 04:05.730
Now you're asking for it!

04:13.230 --> 04:17.110
I do recall dreaming of such a future.

04:17.800 --> 04:22.410
It feels like the dream grows 
more distant as the years pass...

04:22.410 --> 04:25.310
It no longer sounds realistic at all.

04:25.870 --> 04:30.830
It seems we've been too caught up 
in our own so-called mission.

04:31.720 --> 04:34.300
As the king should be, in my opinion.

04:34.300 --> 04:38.260
However, Lady Sei's life continues after this.

04:40.150 --> 04:42.960
Once she achieves complete freedom,

04:42.960 --> 04:48.290
will she be able to grasp
the things that she loves?

05:02.130 --> 05:03.820
So sleepy...

05:07.850 --> 05:08.910
Excuse me.

05:14.790 --> 05:19.760
U-Um, the Magus requests 
immediate approval of a few things

05:19.760 --> 05:23.170
and gave me these documents to deliver.

05:23.170 --> 05:26.610
I'm busy right now, 
so I'll go through them later.

05:27.720 --> 05:29.650
It's fine, it's fine.

05:29.650 --> 05:32.190
Erh always overexaggerates.

05:32.190 --> 05:34.140
B-But...

05:34.140 --> 05:37.410
I'm sure he's the only one who 
understands the documents anyways.

05:39.690 --> 05:43.740
But, well, speaking of...

05:44.180 --> 05:46.200
Just who are you talking about?

05:48.490 --> 05:51.330
Could it be that you came to help?

05:51.330 --> 05:54.250
The documents are really piling up.

05:54.250 --> 05:55.540
Don't act spoiled.

05:55.540 --> 05:58.550
I just came to make sure you're working.

05:58.550 --> 06:00.610
I am, I am.

06:00.610 --> 06:03.760
I've been sacrificing sleep
 for magic research.

06:04.900 --> 06:07.720
I was talking about the paperwork.

06:10.620 --> 06:12.640
Um, what's this?

06:13.070 --> 06:15.100
Oh, that.

06:15.100 --> 06:17.960
You taught me how to make those, remember?

06:17.960 --> 06:20.070
I can't get them to fly very well.

06:20.440 --> 06:21.780
I'm not talking about that.

06:21.780 --> 06:24.480
This looks really important...

06:25.240 --> 06:28.200
I'm busy right now, so I'll look at it later.

06:38.400 --> 06:40.350
An invitation to a play?

06:40.350 --> 06:42.050
An invitation?

06:42.570 --> 06:44.440
A gift of sorts.

06:44.440 --> 06:50.060
Except I'd rather be working
than going to a play I don't care about.

06:50.060 --> 06:53.640
That's because your research
 might as well be your hobby.

06:54.510 --> 06:58.960
I had no idea play invitations
 were so gorgeous.

06:58.960 --> 07:00.570
I'd never seen one before.

07:00.920 --> 07:04.150
Were there no theaters in your homeland?

07:04.150 --> 07:06.490
No, there were a lot of them!

07:07.050 --> 07:10.450
It's just my first time seeing
 a ticket like this.

07:10.930 --> 07:14.220
Oh, not that I know very much about them.

07:14.220 --> 07:17.290
Well, this is probably a patron's invitation.

07:17.710 --> 07:19.250
Patron?

07:19.250 --> 07:23.960
A reservation for a special seat 
prepared for the Drewes family

07:23.960 --> 07:25.270
for their financial support.

07:27.220 --> 07:29.460
Nobles are really amazing...

07:30.220 --> 07:34.390
It's useless to Yuri, 
who cares nothing for the mundane world.

07:34.930 --> 07:36.530
Hurry up and get to work.

07:37.920 --> 07:39.810
U-Um...

07:39.810 --> 07:43.780
Aira, your world has plays too?! 
Isn't that what you said?!

07:43.780 --> 07:45.250
Yes.

07:47.460 --> 07:50.840
Then I'd better hurry up and get to work!

07:50.840 --> 07:52.370
Wait, huh?

07:58.340 --> 08:01.340
I have a really bad feeling about this.

08:09.800 --> 08:12.760
Well, that's all for today.

08:12.760 --> 08:14.890
Thank you very much.

08:18.880 --> 08:23.110
Lady Sei, have you seen a play before?

08:24.090 --> 08:27.070
A play? Like on a stage?

08:27.070 --> 08:30.780
Yes, where they dance and sing. 
That kind of thing.

08:31.100 --> 08:34.690
I went once back in my old world...

08:34.690 --> 08:36.700
I'm glad to hear it.

08:36.700 --> 08:39.920
Now, would you like to go see one together?

08:39.920 --> 08:41.880
Wh-What?

08:41.880 --> 08:46.840
I received two tickets for a play 
being put on in the royal capital.

08:46.840 --> 08:49.050
They came to my parents' home.

08:49.050 --> 08:53.920
Normally, the head of the house would 
attend with his wife, but unfortunately...

08:54.480 --> 08:56.770
They couldn't make it?

08:56.770 --> 08:58.980
Something like that.

08:58.980 --> 09:02.730
So the tickets have fallen to me.

09:02.730 --> 09:07.700
You were the first person 
I thought of asking to go with me.

09:08.420 --> 09:09.460
Huh?

09:09.860 --> 09:13.050
It can only be you, Lady Sei.

09:15.530 --> 09:18.000
Wh-What do you mean by that?

09:18.000 --> 09:21.210
Your world has no magic, correct?

09:21.530 --> 09:23.920
Huh? That's right...

09:23.920 --> 09:26.890
Since our world does, I'd like you to tell me

09:26.890 --> 09:31.000
if the presence or absence of magics
affects theater production.

09:31.000 --> 09:34.850
<i>Oh, that's what he means. The usual.</i>

09:31.000 --> 09:35.600
Don't you think that would be something 
interesting enough to research?

09:35.600 --> 09:40.810
And... it'd be problematic if I invited 
anyone other than you, Lady Sei.

09:40.810 --> 09:42.770
Problematic?

09:43.140 --> 09:46.730
I don't know what conversation
 topics women enjoy.

09:46.730 --> 09:49.690
Even though you're so capable 
when it comes to magic?

09:49.690 --> 09:54.030
It'd be hard for me and put my date
 in an awkward position.

09:54.030 --> 09:57.240
So I'd love to go with you, Lady Sei.

09:59.470 --> 10:03.210
<i>The Grand Magus </i>does<i> always take care of me.</i>

10:03.210 --> 10:07.050
<i>And it's true that I'm intrigued
by what theater is like in this world...</i>

10:08.790 --> 10:11.880
I understand. I'll go with you.

10:11.880 --> 10:14.260
Thank you so much!

10:14.640 --> 10:17.350
This will be the time and location.

10:17.350 --> 10:20.110
Oh, it's in the evening.

10:26.860 --> 10:31.320
Come to think of it, Jude wanted 
to go out to eat together sometime.

10:31.320 --> 10:33.930
I hear he found a really good restaurant.

10:33.930 --> 10:35.160
How nice!

10:35.160 --> 10:38.370
Okay, why don't we go on your next day off?

10:38.370 --> 10:41.750
Oh, I'm sorry. I'm actually busy that day.

10:42.940 --> 10:44.540
You have plans?

10:44.540 --> 10:47.270
Yes, I'm going to a play...

10:47.270 --> 10:50.500
That's right!
 I need to figure out what to wear!

10:50.900 --> 10:54.220
Is there a certain dress code to follow 
when attending a theater play?

10:54.220 --> 10:57.170
That depends on the theater...

10:57.980 --> 11:00.180
Are you going with Lady Ashley?

11:00.520 --> 11:02.640
No, with Lord Drewes.

11:03.300 --> 11:05.770
And when did you promise him that?

11:06.410 --> 11:08.310
During my last lesson.

11:08.310 --> 11:10.400
He invited you himself?

11:10.780 --> 11:15.110
Yes. His family couldn't attend, 
so he had extra tickets.

11:17.810 --> 11:19.430
What's the matter?

11:21.220 --> 11:26.330
The plays in the royal capital are split 
into ones for commoners and ones for nobles.

11:26.330 --> 11:29.460
If you are attending with the Drewes family,
 it must be the latter.

11:31.420 --> 11:37.130
You'll need a dress. You should ask 
the maids in the palace for advice.

11:37.550 --> 11:40.100
Does that mean...

11:40.100 --> 11:41.830
Though it's an evening play,

11:41.830 --> 11:45.060
you'll have to begin preparations 
early in the day.

11:47.020 --> 11:50.230
Of course. Of course that's how it is...

11:50.850 --> 11:52.690
Well, chin up.

11:53.880 --> 11:55.260
Yes.

11:58.950 --> 12:00.440
Yuri Drewes...

12:00.990 --> 12:04.240
No, Marquis Drewes must be behind this.

12:27.330 --> 12:29.750
Good evening, Lady Sei.

12:30.270 --> 12:32.730
G-Good evening.

12:34.460 --> 12:37.640
You look ravishing tonight, Lady Sei.

12:38.740 --> 12:41.200
W-Wait! What are you saying all of a sudden?!

12:41.200 --> 12:44.660
Oh? You didn't like hearing that?

12:44.660 --> 12:49.870
It's not about whether I like it or not. 
What's gotten into you?

12:50.190 --> 12:55.590
My family taught me that this is 
basic courtesy when escorting a woman.

12:56.040 --> 12:58.330
<i>His family did?</i>

12:58.330 --> 13:01.550
<i>He's acting totally different
 from his usual self!</i>

13:02.020 --> 13:04.670
Whatever. Let's go.

13:13.170 --> 13:15.900
Isn't that the entrance to the theater?

13:15.900 --> 13:19.770
Yes, but patrons apparently
 have a private one.

13:19.770 --> 13:21.860
We'll be going in through there.

13:21.860 --> 13:23.740
You don't say—

13:26.030 --> 13:27.260
<i>Calm down!</i>

13:27.260 --> 13:30.870
<i>This is the Grand Magus! 
His only interest is in magic!</i>

14:03.890 --> 14:05.390
What's the matter?

14:06.240 --> 14:09.740
Nothing. It's just not every day
you see a theater like this.

14:10.110 --> 14:13.540
I've never been to a play before myself.

14:13.540 --> 14:15.210
So this is a first for us both.

14:17.370 --> 14:21.590
It looks like all of the chandeliers 
here have magic cast on them.

14:22.160 --> 14:23.840
Indeed, they do.

14:23.840 --> 14:25.820
How novel.

14:25.820 --> 14:29.930
I usually see candles on the 
chandeliers in the royal palace.

14:30.300 --> 14:35.650
Are candles normally used 
for lighting in your world, Lady Sei?

14:35.950 --> 14:39.610
Well, maybe in the past.

14:40.080 --> 14:44.680
There used to be a special job 
for snuffing candles during a play.

14:45.170 --> 14:47.170
Are things different now?

14:47.610 --> 14:51.870
Yes. They're much more convenient now.

14:52.350 --> 14:54.690
We can change lights into an array of colors

14:54.690 --> 14:57.580
and adjust their brightness 
with the touch of a button.

14:57.910 --> 14:59.610
I see.

14:59.610 --> 15:03.150
It would be nice to do such things with magic.

15:04.290 --> 15:06.260
Can't you?

15:06.620 --> 15:07.820
Huh?

15:07.820 --> 15:08.990
Light.

15:12.510 --> 15:15.140
Amazing!

15:15.510 --> 15:17.510
Shh! Shh!

15:19.040 --> 15:24.070
S-Sorry! I was taught that 
we need to be quiet at a theater.

15:25.180 --> 15:26.420
Think nothing of it!

15:26.420 --> 15:30.530
I've only ever considered Light a spell
merely to be cast and canceled.

15:31.100 --> 15:35.500
You've once again opened my eyes, Lady Sei.

15:35.930 --> 15:39.460
I'm flattered to hear that...

15:39.770 --> 15:44.420
I forget not to get stuck in my ways,
both in my research and other things.

15:44.420 --> 15:46.130
I agree.

15:46.670 --> 15:50.600
We need to get close to what we love
and examine it with our own hands.

15:51.080 --> 15:54.560
That way, we may come 
to know ourselves even better.

15:55.460 --> 15:58.020
You think so...?

15:58.020 --> 16:05.490
On that note, I wonder if that light will ever
reveal its golden glow with me by my side.

16:08.050 --> 16:10.420
Oh, don't mind me.

16:13.040 --> 16:15.330
It looks like the play is about to begin.

16:15.330 --> 16:17.030
It does!

16:31.220 --> 16:33.110
They looked so good together!

16:33.110 --> 16:33.950
So true!

16:33.950 --> 16:35.760
It's just as you say!

16:38.600 --> 16:41.560
Good afternoon, Lady Ashley.

16:41.850 --> 16:43.320
Why, good after—

16:43.320 --> 16:45.440
Did you hear?

16:45.440 --> 16:48.110
It's the talk of the town!

16:49.950 --> 16:51.570
What are you talking about?

16:51.570 --> 16:54.990
The Holy Saint! At long last!

16:54.990 --> 16:57.120
She's going to be engaged!

16:57.120 --> 17:01.880
Her partner is the mysterious Grand Magus 
of the Royal Magi Assembly!

17:04.760 --> 17:08.470
Where did you hear such a thing?

17:08.880 --> 17:10.930
Everyone is talking about it!

17:10.930 --> 17:16.890
My cousin's wife's viscount friend's 
servant saw it with their own eyes!

17:16.890 --> 17:21.570
I heard they were so close with each other
that it was hard to even watch!

17:23.230 --> 17:28.690
In other words, none of you saw it yourselves.

17:29.030 --> 17:30.920
Well, that's...

17:30.920 --> 17:33.160
That's true, but...

17:33.160 --> 17:34.410
Even so...

17:34.410 --> 17:38.370
Lady Sei must have her
 own thoughts on the matter.

17:38.930 --> 17:42.170
Shan't we keep to ourselves
 and watch over her?

17:42.960 --> 17:45.260
Y-You're absolutely right!

17:45.260 --> 17:47.250
Too true!

17:47.250 --> 17:51.540
I was just about to say the same thing!

17:56.510 --> 17:58.720
I'm so sorry! I'm so sorry!

17:59.530 --> 18:01.680
Why are you apologizing?

18:02.360 --> 18:05.100
This reminds me of my time at the academy...

18:05.650 --> 18:07.190
The academy?

18:07.610 --> 18:13.220
So much is different in this world
compared to ours.

18:13.220 --> 18:17.360
We view men and women doing things 
together differently than you do here.

18:17.360 --> 18:19.790
I'm sorry for all the trouble I caused...

18:23.740 --> 18:28.570
And yet we were able to become 
true friends because of it.

18:29.170 --> 18:31.130
L-Liz!

18:34.130 --> 18:38.100
I'm sure that Sei is panicking 
right about now.

18:38.100 --> 18:40.530
Well, this is a bit different from my story.

18:40.530 --> 18:43.050
The rumors will probably stop pretty quickly.

18:44.340 --> 18:49.480
They will, if they began organically.

18:51.890 --> 18:56.870
It would benefit their family if people knew 
that she was close to one of them.

18:57.410 --> 19:01.210
There are many who would think that way...

19:14.640 --> 19:16.010
Did you call for me?

19:16.010 --> 19:18.970
Yes, can you deliver some documents?

19:18.970 --> 19:21.090
This one to the First Order.

19:21.090 --> 19:24.430
This one is to the Second. 
This one is to the Third...

19:24.430 --> 19:27.550
No, I'll deliver this one myself.

19:32.640 --> 19:34.320
You wanted to talk to me?

19:34.800 --> 19:37.780
I came to tell you about 
the rumor that's been spreading.

19:38.660 --> 19:40.240
Rumor?

19:40.240 --> 19:43.460
Yes, about Sei and Lord Drewes.

19:43.460 --> 19:44.840
Do you want to know?

19:46.780 --> 19:48.170
Not really.

19:48.170 --> 19:51.380
Come now. I'm here
 because I'm worried about you.

19:52.050 --> 19:56.670
I asked Sei directly, 
and it seems the rumors are false.

19:57.340 --> 19:59.960
They got so excited talking about magic

19:59.960 --> 20:02.310
that she doesn't even remember
 much of the play.

20:02.850 --> 20:06.770
It sounds like there was nary a spark of love.

20:07.210 --> 20:08.480
I imagine not.

20:08.880 --> 20:10.690
You already knew?

20:10.690 --> 20:11.770
No.

20:11.770 --> 20:15.150
But knowing the two of them,
I can tell exactly what happened.

20:15.150 --> 20:18.580
Oh, so you weren't really bothered after all.

20:18.580 --> 20:20.970
I am bothered.

20:23.010 --> 20:24.080
What?

20:24.080 --> 20:27.670
Sei attends plays, huh?

20:28.040 --> 20:30.980
Ah, that took me by surprise too.

20:30.980 --> 20:34.770
She doesn't seem like the type 
who'd enjoy something so stuffy.

20:35.650 --> 20:39.010
If Sei's interested in it, 
I should have invited her.

20:39.310 --> 20:43.970
Could it be that you wanted to be 
the first person to take her?

20:44.440 --> 20:45.590
Got a problem with that?

20:53.380 --> 20:57.820
Marquis Drewes probably 
has something to do with the rumors.

20:58.360 --> 21:00.280
Perhaps.

21:00.280 --> 21:03.930
He probably wants to advertise 
their relationship

21:03.930 --> 21:07.140
and get the public to push for 
his son's engagement to her.

21:07.500 --> 21:12.950
The Grand Magus of the Royal Magi Assembly
 and the Holy Saint, huh?

21:13.420 --> 21:19.380
He'll gain more power that way. 
The plan sounds just like him.

21:24.930 --> 21:31.960
So, I'm probably meddling, 
but shouldn't you make a move soon?

21:33.270 --> 21:36.260
For the sake of the Hawke family?

21:36.260 --> 21:40.700
No, for the sake of your own life.

21:41.020 --> 21:42.790
My own life?

21:43.660 --> 21:48.120
I get that you want to let her 
go at her own pace,

21:48.560 --> 21:52.080
but there are times when 
just waiting isn't enough.

21:52.460 --> 21:56.110
You should grab hold of what
you love with your own hands.

21:56.710 --> 21:59.050
Isn't that what life is all about?

23:35.020 --> 23:40.020
Next Time
